# Method III: 4D Spectral Voxel Instrument (Refined)

## Implementation
```javascript
function mapVoxelToHarmonic(v) {
  const base = v.w > 0 ? 329.63 : 196.00; // E to G transition
  return base * Math.pow(1.059, (v.x + v.y + v.z) % 12);
}

function render() {
  ctx.globalAlpha = 1 / (1 + Math.abs(voxel.w / 100));
  ctx.fillRect(voxel.x, voxel.y, 10, 10);
}
```

## Refinement Notes
- Integrated exponential harmonic scaling for smooth pitch transitions.
- Added Z-axis/W-axis alpha attenuation to produce a depth-sensitive 4D field effect.

